1
00:00:03,104 --> 00:00:06,207
50 years have passed.

2
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:10,211
But I do not age.

3
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:16,984
Time has lost its effect on me.

4
00:00:21,055 --> 00:00:24,892
Yet the suffering continues.

5
00:00:26,294 --> 00:00:32,566
Aku's grasp chokes the past,
present, and future.

6
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:36,537
Hope is lost.

7
00:00:36,570 --> 00:00:38,706
Got to get back --

8
00:00:38,739 --> 00:00:40,708
back to the past.

9
00:00:40,741 --> 00:00:42,376
Samurai Jack.

10
00:01:17,010 --> 00:01:20,481
Oh!
Hello, little friend.

11
00:01:20,514 --> 00:01:22,916
I don't suppose you know
if there is a time portal

12
00:01:22,950 --> 00:01:26,254
atop this mountain, do you?

13
00:01:26,287 --> 00:01:27,588
No?

14
00:01:27,621 --> 00:01:29,390
Yes?

15
00:01:30,958 --> 00:01:32,760
Aku has destroyed many.

16
00:01:32,793 --> 00:01:35,329
I worry that
there are none left.

17
00:02:44,232 --> 00:02:44,998
Phew!

18
00:02:45,032 --> 00:02:47,201
That was close!

19
00:02:47,235 --> 00:02:51,339
I didn't think
you'd get here so fast.

20
00:02:54,908 --> 00:02:56,344
Fool!

21
00:03:01,549 --> 00:03:03,351
Oh, fun fact --

22
00:03:03,384 --> 00:03:10,057
that was the last remaining
time portal in existence!

23
00:03:20,734 --> 00:03:23,103
Ooh, so angry!

24
00:03:23,136 --> 00:03:24,738
Be careful, Samurai --

25
00:03:24,772 --> 00:03:28,208
so much stress
will give you a heart attack.

26
00:03:28,242 --> 00:03:31,044
Ooh!
What am I saying?

27
00:03:31,078 --> 00:03:32,580
Please continue!

28
00:03:32,613 --> 00:03:34,948
Never mind what I said!

29
00:03:38,886 --> 00:03:40,721
Whoa!

30
00:03:41,989 --> 00:03:43,056
Ho, ho!

31
00:03:43,090 --> 00:03:45,359
Not so fast, Samurai.

32
00:03:45,393 --> 00:03:48,962
I know better than
to mess with that sword!

33
00:03:50,264 --> 00:03:52,032
But before I go,

34
00:03:52,065 --> 00:03:55,736
I'll leave you
someone to play with.

35
00:05:13,847 --> 00:05:15,215
And so...

36
00:05:15,248 --> 00:05:17,718
I was not able to find it again.

37
00:05:23,190 --> 00:05:24,224
There!

38
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,742
We are here.

39
00:06:57,250 --> 00:06:59,453
It's not here.

40
00:06:59,487 --> 00:07:01,555
Could someone else
have taken it?

41
00:07:01,589 --> 00:07:03,724
No.

42
00:07:03,757 --> 00:07:05,626
I realize now that...

43
00:07:05,659 --> 00:07:08,328
I did not
lose the sword...

44
00:07:08,361 --> 00:07:09,997
but the sword left me.

45
00:07:19,039 --> 00:07:20,908
Thank you, friend.

46
00:07:20,941 --> 00:07:22,342
Yes, thank you.

47
00:07:34,522 --> 00:07:37,257
I do not know
how long this may take.

48
00:07:37,290 --> 00:07:38,792
I'll go with you.

49
00:07:38,826 --> 00:07:40,127
You cannot.

50
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:43,330
It is something that
I must do on my own.

51
00:07:44,397 --> 00:07:45,666
Wait, I...

52
00:07:53,173 --> 00:07:56,276
Oh.
I guess I'll just...

53
00:07:56,309 --> 00:07:58,178
wait here.

54
00:11:02,362 --> 00:11:04,998
Are you lost?

55
00:11:05,032 --> 00:11:06,834
Yes.

56
00:11:06,867 --> 00:11:08,168
Good.

57
00:11:08,201 --> 00:11:09,870
Come make tea.

58
00:11:29,056 --> 00:11:30,724
Hold it.

59
00:11:30,758 --> 00:11:34,728
Where do you
think you're going?

60
00:11:34,762 --> 00:11:37,030
Up the mountain,
to kill the Samurai.

61
00:11:37,064 --> 00:11:38,465
What's it to you?

62
00:11:40,868 --> 00:11:43,036
I'm going to stop you.

63
00:11:51,211 --> 00:11:54,047
Hey, why have we
stopped? What's so funny?

64
00:11:54,081 --> 00:11:55,548
It's a girl!

65
00:11:55,582 --> 00:11:58,618
She says
she's going to stop us.

66
00:11:58,651 --> 00:12:00,520
What did he say?

67
00:12:00,553 --> 00:12:02,222
Something about
a squirrel.

68
00:12:02,255 --> 00:12:04,091
I love squirrels!

69
00:12:04,124 --> 00:12:05,893
Is it lunch already?

70
00:12:05,926 --> 00:12:08,061
So a little thing like you

71
00:12:08,095 --> 00:12:10,898
is gonna stop
this whole army, huh?

72
00:12:10,931 --> 00:12:12,199
Yep.

73
00:12:12,232 --> 00:12:15,903
We're gonna rip you apart
in a bunch of pieces,

74
00:12:15,936 --> 00:12:18,071
and then we're gonna
take those pieces

75
00:12:18,105 --> 00:12:21,574
and rip them apart
into even more pieces!

76
00:12:21,608 --> 00:12:23,076
I'm waiting.

77
00:12:23,110 --> 00:12:24,244
Hmm.

78
00:12:49,169 --> 00:12:50,270
- Huh?
- Huh?

79
00:16:23,683 --> 00:16:24,651
Mother?

80
00:16:24,684 --> 00:16:27,154
I knew you would fail us.

81
00:16:27,187 --> 00:16:30,990
You were the strongest,
but the most unfocused.

82
00:16:31,024 --> 00:16:35,328
Always distracted,
questioning everything.

83
00:16:35,362 --> 00:16:37,697
But all that can change.

84
00:16:37,730 --> 00:16:40,767
You can still honor
our Lord Father.

85
00:16:41,534 --> 00:16:44,937
Destroy the Samurai,
Ashi.

86
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:49,008
No.

87
00:16:49,042 --> 00:16:51,044
You were wrong
about everything.

88
00:16:51,078 --> 00:16:53,646
Jack showed me
the truth.

89
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:55,782
Then you, too, will die.

90
00:17:46,766 --> 00:17:49,469
How could you
betray your family?

91
00:17:49,502 --> 00:17:51,738
He killed your sisters!

92
00:17:51,771 --> 00:17:54,641
And you let him live!

93
00:17:55,775 --> 00:17:57,744
No, you killed them!

94
00:17:57,777 --> 00:17:59,779
We were made
for one purpose --

95
00:17:59,812 --> 00:18:01,114
to kill!

96
00:18:01,148 --> 00:18:03,616
Our fate was sealed
the day we were born!

97
00:18:06,419 --> 00:18:09,222
The Samurai
is our mortal enemy.

98
00:18:09,256 --> 00:18:13,626
He must die
at any cost.

99
00:18:15,595 --> 00:18:16,629
No.

100
00:18:33,613 --> 00:18:35,582
This is terrible.

101
00:18:35,615 --> 00:18:37,450
Really?

102
00:18:37,484 --> 00:18:38,518
Yes.

103
00:18:38,551 --> 00:18:40,620
Yes, quite terrible.

104
00:18:40,653 --> 00:18:43,923
This tea has all
the necessary ingredients...

105
00:18:43,956 --> 00:18:47,594
but it lacks
the most important one --

106
00:18:47,627 --> 00:18:49,128
balance.

107
00:18:49,162 --> 00:18:53,500
I see why your path to the sword
remains clouded.

108
00:18:53,533 --> 00:18:55,468
This isn't the path?!

109
00:18:55,502 --> 00:18:56,803
I don't understand.

110
00:18:56,836 --> 00:18:58,805
Then you must
show me the way!

111
00:18:58,838 --> 00:19:00,940
I cannot.

112
00:19:00,973 --> 00:19:04,811
It is not for me
to show you your path.

113
00:19:04,844 --> 00:19:06,813
That's fortune cookie
nonsense!

114
00:19:06,846 --> 00:19:10,049
He knows where it is.
He just won't tell you.

115
00:19:10,082 --> 00:19:12,819
Please,
you must tell me.

116
00:19:12,852 --> 00:19:15,955
That is something
you must earn.

117
00:19:15,988 --> 00:19:17,857
Earn?!

118
00:19:17,890 --> 00:19:20,193
After everything
we've done,

119
00:19:20,227 --> 00:19:22,295
everything
we've been through --

120
00:19:22,329 --> 00:19:27,300
the death, the loss,
the suffering!

121
00:19:27,334 --> 00:19:31,003
Who are you to deny us
what is rightfully ours!?

122
00:19:31,037 --> 00:19:33,406
Enough.

123
00:19:34,674 --> 00:19:37,310
We have lost the sword
because of you.

124
00:19:37,344 --> 00:19:39,512
I have kept us alive!

125
00:19:39,546 --> 00:19:41,748
He's the one
who has taken it from us!

126
00:19:41,781 --> 00:19:43,416
He knows where it is!

127
00:19:43,450 --> 00:19:45,184
No.

128
00:19:45,218 --> 00:19:48,988
I've let you consume me
for far too long.

129
00:19:49,021 --> 00:19:51,224
You're in my way.

130
00:19:54,227 --> 00:19:55,395
You.

131
00:19:55,428 --> 00:19:58,231
You are the one who has
kept the past hidden.

132
00:19:58,265 --> 00:20:03,202
Your anger,
your frustration.

133
00:20:03,236 --> 00:20:05,905
You're a fool!

134
00:20:05,938 --> 00:20:08,207
You have blinded us,

135
00:20:08,241 --> 00:20:10,910
but now I can see.

136
00:20:10,943 --> 00:20:14,914
You need me!

137
00:20:14,947 --> 00:20:18,385
Now you are balanced.

138
00:20:24,257 --> 00:20:28,295
Like your father,
you have been chosen.

139
00:20:28,328 --> 00:20:32,231
To stop a force of
ultimate evil.

140
00:20:32,265 --> 00:20:35,468
You are worthy.

141
00:21:21,981 --> 00:21:23,783
Ashi.

142
00:21:28,721 --> 00:21:30,357
Jack?

143
00:21:30,390 --> 00:21:31,524
Yes.

144
00:21:31,558 --> 00:21:32,925
It is me.

145
00:21:32,959 --> 00:21:34,627
You got your sword.

146
00:21:34,661 --> 00:21:37,964
And a shave
and a haircut.

147
00:21:37,997 --> 00:21:40,500
Hmm, yes.

148
00:21:40,533 --> 00:21:41,868
And you...

149
00:21:41,901 --> 00:21:43,670
you have been
very busy.

150
00:21:43,703 --> 00:21:45,972
Ow.

151
00:21:47,674 --> 00:21:48,875
Thank you.

152
00:21:48,908 --> 00:21:52,044
So, what next?

153
00:21:52,078 --> 00:21:55,648
Aku!

154
00:21:55,682 --> 00:21:56,849
* Watch out

155
00:21:56,883 --> 00:21:58,785
* Got to get back,
back to the past *

156
00:21:58,818 --> 00:21:59,952
* Samurai Jack

157
00:21:59,986 --> 00:22:01,320
* Watch out

158
00:22:05,925 --> 00:22:07,827
* Got to get back,
back to the past *

159
00:22:07,860 --> 00:22:08,995
* Samurai Jack

160
00:22:09,028 --> 00:22:10,329
* Watch out

161
00:22:13,332 --> 00:22:16,068
* Jack, Jack,
Jack, Jack, Jack *

162
00:22:19,005 --> 00:22:19,972
* Watch out

163
00:22:20,006 --> 00:22:21,340
* Got to get back

164
00:22:21,374 --> 00:22:23,342
* Samurai Jack
* Jack, Jack, Jack

165
00:22:23,376 --> 00:22:25,745
* Wa-Watch out
* Jack, Jack, Jack, Jack
